---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Trajectory from './Trajectory.astro';
---
<div class="me">
  <p class="me-big"><span class="acc-day">I'm Lalit.</span> I work on AI products at Ford, and spent the eight years before that at JP Morgan Chase.</p>
  <div class="me-body">
    {site.photo && <img class="me-photo" src={site.photo} alt="Lalit Shewani, arms folded, looking to the side" loading="lazy" width="132" height="132" />}
    <p>Today that means document intelligence, an audit agent that keeps a person in charge, and AI tools for teams outside engineering. At the bank I went from writing trade-processing code to leading data and machine learning products, and helped run the Bengaluru PM community events.</p>
    <div class="about-cta">
      <a class="btn" href={site.resume} download>Download resume</a>
      <a class="btn" href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/about/">Full story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="me-stairs"><Trajectory /></div>
